stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> New
    
    New --> Ready : admitted
    Ready --> Running : scheduler dispatch
    Running --> Ready : interrupt / preempt
    Running --> Waiting : I/O or event wait
    Waiting --> Ready : I/O or event completion
    Running --> Terminated : exit
    
    Terminated --> [*]
    
    state New {
        [*] --> Creating
    }
    state Ready {
        [*] --> InMemory
    }
    state Running {
        [*] --> Executing
    }
    state Waiting {
        [*] --> Blocked
    }
    state Terminated {
        [*] --> Zombie
        Zombime --> Cleaned : parent wait()
    }
    
    note right of New : Process being created\nPCB allocated
    note right of Ready : In memory\nwaiting for CPU
    note right of Running : Instructions\nexecuting on CPU
    note right of Waiting : Waiting for I/O\nor event
    note right of Terminated : Process finished\nresources released
